    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CONSTITUTION OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      242.57,
      401.89,
      266.99
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      281.57,
      401.88,
      305.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Twenty First Amendmentto the Constitution.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      320.57,
      401.89,
      396.95
    ],
    "text": "2.Article 99 of the Constitution of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka (hereinafter referred to as''the Constitution'') is hereby amended by the substitution insubparagraph (a) of Paragraph (6) of that Article for the words''less than one twentieth of the total votes'' of the words ''lessthan one eighth of the total votes''.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      411.65,
      401.89,
      435.95
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
